{"v":4,"catch":"編碼遊戲。熬過夜晚。","desc":"GLITCH: Dead Loop Horror 是一款第一人稱心理恐怖遊戲，玩家將扮演一名獨自留在辦公室完成專案的程式設計師。但隨著夜幕低垂，現實開始瓦解。解決神秘的謎題、調試詭異的異常現象，並在黑暗的大廳中躲避未知的敵人。\n氣氛變得更加神秘。熟悉的地方開始變得陌生。您走得越深，一切就越不穩定。\n牆壁似乎會在您不注意的時候移動。遊戲與現實之間的界限模糊成一個扭曲的循環。每個解決方案都會帶來更深的不確定性。\n有些程式碼是無法修復的...","publisher":"Play Lab","release":"2025-07-03","genres":["動作","冒險","模擬","益智"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.7GB / Switch 0.7GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/dee7acb81c1ad261bbfe06afeb7ce5d9092906f1227dd9f7ce616fc1cac98e69.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f7f5224cbbdb51b66ba3f7dff88d5e0a4a4ff413355e6ef0b5e234d08a6126db.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/b04f2d491ccca508dd422fe3eb2fd51ada5d8906970a8b0a6a31a69a20ea26dd.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/57f9f2dfb9ceacb4e31eb9a71925c4532c2125920f6b48ad53fbb85fbe08afed.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e0aa6644b1c26b02d39aa8959e29ec9616795f8ab540d13af44ae2833b6c0da5.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d2da221aca8e065c3ad21e1e91b3141bb698e39c1a466fce1a1305c893ff7f8a.jpg"],"titleId":"0100b0f023eb4000","dlc":[]}